"epo"><addressbook><name>MITSUBISHI MOTORS CORP</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OKADA KOJIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAMURA YASUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>DOGAHARA, TAKASHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MITSUBISHI JIDOSHA KOGYO KABUSHIKI KAISHA</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OKADA, KOJIRO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAMURA, YASUKI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>DOGAHARA TAKASHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OKADA KOJIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAMURA YASUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>DOGAHARA, TAKASHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OKADA, KOJIRO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAMURA, YASUKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An NOx sensor (27) detects an NOx concentration released to the atmosphere from an occlusion type NOx catalyst (25); a total NOx exhaust amount (A) is calculated based on the output from the NOx sensor (27); when a total NOx emission amount (A) reaches an NOx emission decision amount (A0) corresponding to an NOx emission decision amount specified by the NOx Emission Regulation before a running distance (C) reaches a preset running distance (C0), an exhaust air/fuel ratio is changed to a rich air/fuel ratio to thereby efficiently release NOx from the occlusion type NOx catalyst (25); and then a theoretical air/fuel ratio is changed to clean and reduce NOx by a three-way catalyst function.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Cette invention concerne un capteur de NOx (27) qui détecte une concentration de NOx libérée dans l'atmosphère par un pot catalytique à occlusion (25). A partir du signal émis par le capteur de NOx (27), on calcule la teneur totale des gaz d'échappement en NOx (A). Lorsque cette teneur totale (A) atteint une valeur critique (A0) correspondant à un seuil défini la par la réglementation antipollution NOx avant que la distance parcourue (C) n'atteigne une distance prédéterminée (C0), on enrichit le rapport de manière à libérer efficacement des NOx du pot catalytique à occlusion (25). On agit ensuite un rapport théorique air/carburant de manière à modifier et à réduire la teneur en NOx au moyen d'une fonction catalytique à trois voix.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>